Problem Statement

Design a food delivery service like Uber Eats or DoorDash that connects customers with restaurants and delivery partners. Focus on the core ordering and delivery flow.

Key Requirements

Functional Requirements

Users: Customers can browse restaurants, place orders, and track deliveries

Restaurants: Can manage their menu and receive orders

Delivery Partners: Can accept delivery assignments and update delivery status

Core Features:

Restaurant search by location, for simplicity, we should be able to find the restaurant within x km radius

Order placement and payment

Real-time order tracking and status tracking with audit log

Basic delivery partner assignment

Non-Functional Requirements

Scale: 10M users, 100K restaurants, 50K delivery partners

Peak load: 100K concurrent users during dinner time (7-9 PM)

Latency: Search results < 500ms, order placement < 2s

Availability: 99.9% uptime

Remember: We're looking for a design you can explain and defend, not perfection. Make assumptions where needed and communicate them clearly.


